# Inherits the project's root .clang-tidy and disables one check for tests only.
#
# bugprone-unchecked-optional-access cannot see through GoogleTest's ASSERT_TRUE /
# ASSERT_*  macros (they are not modeled by its dataflow analysis), so every
# `r->field` access that is already guarded by `ASSERT_TRUE(r.has_value())` is
# flagged as a false positive. Restructuring each access with an explicit `if`
# would make the tests substantially less readable for no real safety gain (a
# wrong access aborts the test visibly anyway). Every other check still applies.
---
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: "-bugprone-unchecked-optional-access"
